1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,594
What if your everyday life felt a little more like an adventure?

2
00:00:05,417 --> 00:00:09,165
Welcome to Questbound, a place where small, real-world actions

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,382
become quests, progress becomes a story, and you are the hero at

4
00:00:13,417 --> 00:00:14,203
the heart of it.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,355
Begin with your character.

6
00:00:19,004 --> 00:00:22,361
Choose a class, then build six attributes through the things you

7
00:00:22,396 --> 00:00:27,774
actually do. Reading, movement, creativity, and connection all

8
00:00:27,809 --> 00:00:31,122
have a place. Your character sheet brings those different kinds

9
00:00:31,157 --> 00:00:33,159
of progress into one view.

10
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:38,605
Next, turn intention into a quest.

11
00:00:39,124 --> 00:00:43,198
Give it a clear title. Choose the attribute it trains, and set an

12
00:00:43,233 --> 00:00:47,828
honest difficulty. Make it a one-time goal, a daily routine or a

13
00:00:47,863 --> 00:00:51,561
repeatable habit. Start with something small enough to do today.

14
00:00:54,783 --> 00:00:57,286
Do the work in real life, then seal the quest.

15
00:00:58,044 --> 00:01:01,792
Earn experience and gold, see your progress grow, and keep a

16
00:01:01,827 --> 00:01:03,438
