17
00:01:04,544 --> 00:01:07,351
These rewards are a celebration of showing up.

18
00:01:07,892 --> 00:01:11,003
The real achievement is the step you took beyond the screen.

19
00:01:14,283 --> 00:01:15,960
And you do not have to travel alone.

20
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:20,727
Enter the Guild Hall to ask a question, share a useful tip, or

21
00:01:20,762 --> 00:01:24,640
celebrate a small win. Open a discussion, learn from another

22
00:01:24,675 --> 00:01:27,873
