23
00:01:28,349 --> 00:01:30,590
Contribution matters more than popularity.

24
00:01:34,325 --> 00:01:36,458
Find a guild that shares your direction.

25
00:01:37,434 --> 00:01:40,703
Explore its members and shared quests, then join a community

26
00:01:40,738 --> 00:01:45,377
challenge. Eligible quests completed after enrollment can move a

27
00:01:45,412 --> 00:01:46,936
