30
00:01:55,867 --> 00:01:59,913
The Hall of Heroes recognizes progress and helpful contributions.

31
00:02:00,606 --> 00:02:01,739
Prefer less competition?

32
00:02:02,454 --> 00:02:05,962
Turn on quiet mode. You can also switch off the magical effects

33
00:02:05,997 --> 00:02:08,326
