36
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:20,920
A candlelit world. A character that grows with you.

37
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,268
And a community built around taking the next small step.

38
00:02:24,765 --> 00:02:27,159
This walkthrough uses fictional demo data.

39
00:02:27,417 --> 00:02:29,224
Your own story is still unwritten.

40
00:02:29,765 --> 00:02:34,355
Visit Questbound, create your hero, and begin your next chapter today.
